    "id": "ACT-GRAM",
    "revision": 6,
    "title": "Build larger phrases",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk2-phrase-types-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Build larger phrases",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "A 的 phrase can stand for an understood noun. Serial verbs share a subject; pivotal phrases share a person between two predicates. 什么的 leaves a list open. An expanded verb-complement phrase can serve as predicate; an adjectival phrase can modify a noun with 的.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "好的是我的。",
                "pinyin": "hǎo de shì wǒ de 。",
                "meaning": "The good one is mine.",
                "audio": "5736d4e0261973ef6a92572674863ff759518c619b6de2dd9b6d03e6d1016394"
              },
              {
                "text": "我去学校学习。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ qù xuéxiào xuéxí 。",
                "meaning": "I go to school to study.",
                "audio": "e8ba1f85576a8e4a733d22e43a97a02b02d13dc4fd2aeff4e2b8b322af97ffdc"
              },
              {
                "text": "我请他来。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ qǐng tā lái 。",
                "meaning": "I invite him to come.",
                "audio": "001bd221d48c1d3add2f25e80a24c2cd690c73537f1127e690901e8259afd109"
              },
              {
                "text": "我买了书什么的。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ mǎi le shū shénmede 。",
                "meaning": "I bought books and things like that.",
                "audio": "3ccff4dd6e9941a6baccde3ad250aae6ba37aa81094dae3dc238ea65180b641f"
              },
              {
                "text": "我看完这本书了。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ kàn wán zhè běn shū le 。",
                "meaning": "I have finished reading this book.",
                "audio": "cab65becb06284761726e687c6a8700a0a218c5c2ac3ab3a84dcbb0a2ff5e021"
              },
              {
                "text": "这是很好的书。",
                "pinyin": "zhè shì hěn hǎo de shū 。",
                "meaning": "This is a very good book.",
                "audio": "2cd77db9949e8510222a30b1304636c034cf948295b67ee448374514fd074667"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
